vendor-optimized Adreno kernels;

ExecuTorch Qualcomm backend;

other GGML backends;

mobile speculative decoding systems.

Do not include a project merely because it has "LLM" in its README.

For every newly discovered candidate determine:

is it active?

does it actually perform inference locally?

is Android supported?

is it open source?

what model formats are supported?

what hardware paths exist?

does it demonstrate something technically superior to Prism?

is it realistically integrable?

is the license compatible?

is the maintenance risk acceptable?

Rank newly discovered systems by research value.

