Do not design a generic abstraction merely because it looks architecturally elegant.

Require evidence that multiple engines justify their maintenance burden.

Define explicit kill criteria for alternate-engine experiments.

Example:

«If MNN does not achieve a sufficiently material sustained improvement over optimized llama.cpp under equivalent quality/memory conditions, do not integrate it.»

