Distinguish:

MUST FIX

Correctness or misleading runtime behavior.

HIGH ROI

Likely measurable improvement with reasonable effort.

EXPERIMENT

Potentially valuable but evidence insufficient.

LONG TERM

NPU/vendor/secondary-runtime work.

REJECT

Not worth current complexity.

